# One project per line: <path> [layout]. Each becomes an inner tmux session
# named after the directory. Layouts are the layout_* functions in ./mn:
#
#   dev     claude | nvim over a spare shell   (default)
#   agent   claude | a spare shell
#
# Only main checkouts go here. Task worktrees are made with M-n, appear under
# their project in the sidebar, and always use the task layout. Tell mn how to
# set one up by adding a .mullion/project.sh to the repo; see the README.
#
~/projects/api
~/projects/frontend   agent
